                                                "sense_id": "e2f9ec5a-37b8-396e-b972-fdf635f22ddc",
                                                "text": "In one conversation, HDF’s organiser was recorded discussing “remigration” – a euphemism for the mass removal of ethnic minorities – saying: “You’ve just got to pay people to go home.” […] In multiple conversations, HDF’s organisers suggested their interests were also political."
